     "description": "Instantaneous pin of the sea_freezing_temperature template - the coupled shr_frz_freezetemp law Tf = max(sss/(-18.48+0.01848*sss), -2.0) (share/shr_frz_mod.F90.in:94-105, imported at ice_import_export.F90:818-821; bugs.md #6) - against cice_freezing_temp.csv row (step 1, i=2, j=4): So_s = 3.42863573710123717e+01 psu (the import sss = So_s, F90:480-481) gives Tf = -1.92119308111924614e+00 C to round-off.",
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
